BT 1 0 0 1 0 96.4 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 13.2 TL (This study examines a Spring Cloud hospital-management application at the supplied baseline, evolves it) Tj T* (through three approved service changes, and compares two design patterns across four languages. The original) Tj T* (archive contains Eureka, a Gateway, Auth, Patient and Appointment modules. Its confirmed baseline inventory is) Tj T* (11 collaborations across six pattern labels. The evolved application adds Doctor, Pharmacy, Laboratory, Billing) Tj T* (and Notification. The full Maven reactor passed 17 unit tests and an all-service Gateway smoke flow passed 14) Tj T* (of 14 expected HTTP outcomes. Strategy and Adapter demonstrations in Java, C++, Python and JavaScript) Tj T* (passed equivalent checks. Team identity, student contributions, upstream source URL/commit, faculty approval) Tj T* (and a verbatim desktop model transcript were not supplied.) Tj T* ET
